IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CONTAINER-MONITOR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SERVICE-NAME          PIC X(20) VALUE "NGINX-SERVICE".
       01  SERVICE-STATUS        PIC X(10) VALUE "RUNNING".
       01  UPTIME                PIC 9(5)    VALUE 120.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       DISPLAY-STATUS.
           DISPLAY "--- MONITORING REPORT ---"
           DISPLAY "SERVICE: " SERVICE-NAME
           DISPLAY "STATUS:  " SERVICE-STATUS
           DISPLAY "UPTIME:  " UPTIME " SECONDS"
           DISPLAY "-------------------------"
           STOP RUN.